@290010 = ~Avenging Cowface of Time~
@290011 = ~Paragon of Bovine Vengeance~
@290012 = ~Die, meat-eaters!~
@290013 = ~Vengeance for the cows!~
@290014 = ~Death to carnivores!~

@290019 = ~Warning message.~
@290020 = ~To whoever reads these lines: know that I have traveled across many planes and visited many inhospitable places. I have faced the most dangerous monsters and endured the most persistent curses. But nothing could have prepared me for what I experienced when I discovered what lies outside this cave. So here is my advice: if you value your sanity, use a portal and go home; do not leave this cave. No one can ever be ready to face horrors such as those waiting outside.~

